---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/hubert-portrait.jpg';

const signup = 'https://app.kneadmanager.com/#signup';
const recettes = [
  { nom: 'Entremets 6 personnes', avant: '41 %', apres: '38 %' },
  { nom: 'Flan 8 parts', avant: '58 %', apres: '56 %' },
  { nom: 'Saint-Honoré', avant: '52 %', apres: '49 %' },
];
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Sachez enfin ce que chaque gâteau vous rapporte.</h1>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="lead">Photographiez vos factures fournisseurs. Knead met vos prix d'achat à jour et recalcule le coût et la marge de chaque recette, sans tableur le dimanche soir.</p>
        <a href={signup} class="btn btn-gold">Essayer gratuitement 7 jours</a>
        <p class="note">Sans carte bancaire. Annulation en un clic.</p>
        <div class="founder">
          <Image src={portrait} alt="" width={44} height={44} widths={[44, 88]} sizes="44px" format="webp" />
          <p>Conçu par <strong>Hubert Le Dorven</strong>, pâtissier depuis 17 ans.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fragment recréé en HTML, chiffres d'exemple : à aligner sur l'app réelle. -->
      <div class="ui" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="event">
          <span class="event-label">Facture scannée</span>
          <div class="event-line"><b>Beurre de tourage</b><span class="up">9,20 → 9,85 €/kg</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ui-head"><b>Marges recalculées</b><span>Exemple</span></div>
        <ul>
          {recettes.map((r) => (
            <li><span>{r.nom}</span><span class="vals"><s>{r.avant}</s><b>{r.apres}</b></span></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { background: var(--navy); color: #fff; padding-block: 72px 80px; }
  h1 { color: #fff; max-width: 15em; font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 5.25rem); }
  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr); gap: 72px; align-items: end; margin-top: 56px; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--on-navy-2); max-width: 30em; }
  .btn { margin-top: 28px; }
  .note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--on-navy-2); }
  .founder { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .16); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--on-navy-2); }
  .founder img { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .founder strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }

  .ui {
    padding: 24px 28px 14px; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.35; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .event { padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--paper); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .event-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .event-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 16px; }
  .event-line b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }
  .up { font-weight: 600; color: var(--loss); }
  .ui-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .ui-head b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }
  ul { list-style: none; }
  li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F0EEE7; }
  li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .vals { display: flex; gap: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .vals s { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .vals b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero { padding-block: 40px 48px; }
    .row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 40px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .lead { font-size: 1.125rem; }
    .btn { width: 100%; }
    .ui { padding: 18px 18px 8px; }
  }
</style>
